54
00:04:26,797 --> 00:04:27,773
So it says.

55
00:04:27,773 --> 00:04:32,916
if you want to get to D,
you can go via AS4, the path.

56
00:04:32,916 --> 00:04:38,003
All right, so right here,
we're basically making

57
00:04:38,003 --> 00:04:44,140
