73
00:06:00,409 --> 00:06:04,630
It would send an update to AS3 that,

74
00:06:04,630 --> 00:06:09,121
hey, you can reach D via the path AS2,

75
00:06:09,121 --> 00:06:12,948
AS4 and it would also toil AS1.

76
00:06:12,948 --> 00:06:17,885
You can get to D via AS2,
AS4 via this path.

77
00:06:17,885 --> 00:06:21,847
So if we zoom in on
the router in the AS2 and

78
00:06:21,847 --> 00:06:27,173
