79
00:06:27,173 --> 00:06:30,141
it has known the destination.

80
00:06:30,141 --> 00:06:35,585
So these are the prefix and
it has two routes that it can choose from.

81
00:06:35,585 --> 00:06:41,215
It has route AS2, AS4 and
