00:07:33,176 --> 00:07:36,340
It's going to choose the direct one.

94
00:07:36,340 --> 00:07:40,420
AS4 has a direct connection to the prefix.

95
00:07:40,420 --> 00:07:43,757
Now AS1 has two choices.

