relate to how it would choose, but
definitely needed to understand

103
00:08:18,722 --> 00:08:24,637
how BGP works is what happens if
there's some dynamics in the network.

104
00:08:24,637 --> 00:08:27,528
So for example, AS4,

105
00:08:27,528 --> 00:08:33,317
the link between AS3 and
AS4 say it goes down.

106
00:08:33,317 --> 00:08:38,139
So here, AS3 which previously
had these two entries in its

