00:08:38,139 --> 00:08:41,619
routing table would detect that failure.

108
00:08:41,619 --> 00:08:49,302
Delete this entry, the second entry
that says that it can reach via AS4.

109
00:08:49,302 --> 00:08:52,365
So it updates its routing table.

110
00:08:52,365 --> 00:08:57,118
And now, it's going to have to
tell its neighbors that I'm

111
00:08:57,118 --> 00:09:02,081
going to withdraw that path that
