112
00:09:02,081 --> 00:09:10,365
I told you that you can reach D via AS3,
AS4.

113
00:09:10,365 --> 00:09:12,119
That's no longer the case.

114
00:09:12,119 --> 00:09:14,948
All right, so
that's the first part of this.

115
00:09:14,948 --> 00:09:20,448
Now the second part is because
