117
00:09:25,643 --> 00:09:28,418
So it sends an update message.

118
00:09:28,418 --> 00:09:34,294
So for example,
it sends in this picture to AS1 but

119
00:09:34,294 --> 00:09:39,623
it would send it to all
of its neighbors that you

120
00:09:39,623 --> 00:09:45,786
can reach prefix D via AS3,
then AS2 and then AS4.

121
00:09:45,786 --> 00:09:47,084
And in this case,

122
00:09:47,084 --> 00:09:52,639
it didn't send it to AS2 because that's
